{
    "song_id": 10087337,
    "title": "Overcompensate",
    "language": "en",
    "lyricists": "[50268, 574050]",
    "lyrics": [
        {
            "section_id": "section_0",
            "type": "intro",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Welcome back to Trench",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Welcome back to Trench",
                    "persona_id": "Blurryface"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_1",
            "type": "break",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "I created this world",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "To feel some control",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "Destroy it if I want",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "So I sing Sahlo Folina",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Sahlo Folina",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "(Wait, what? Wait, what?)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "(Wait, what? Wait, what?)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_2",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Earned my stripes, three hundred tracks in my Adidas track jacket",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Bless your ear holes while you react, acting",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "Gobsmacked, don't hesitate",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "To maybe overcompensate",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "I feel like I was just here, same twitchin' in my eyes",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "Don't sleep on a boy who can't fall asleep twice",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "In the same night, and won't hesitate",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "To maybe overcompensate",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_3",
            "type": "chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "I said I fly by the dangerous bend symbol (Wait, what? Wait, what?)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Mm, don't hesitate to maybe overcompensate",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "And then by the time I catch in my peripheral (Wait, what? Wait, what?)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Mm, don't hesitate to maybe overcompensate",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_4",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Where am I from? I was born right here, just now",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Originated right in front of your eyes",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "If you can't see, I am Clancy, prodigal son",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Done running, come up with Josh Dun, wanted dead or alive",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "So now you pick who you serve, you bow to the masses",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "Get kicked to the curb for passin' the classes",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "Half empty, half full, save half for your taxes",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "Then overtake your former self",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_5",
            "type": "chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
